Subject: [PATCH 3/6] axon7: VINTF manifest for lineage-22.2 (target level 5)

As msm8996-common 22.2: manifest version 2.0, target-level 5, audio 6.0;
entries now declared by the HALs' own VINTF fragments or gone in Android
15 removed (bluetooth.audio, configstore, drm, gnss + vendor.qti.gnss,
health, memtrack, renderscript, cryptfshw). Radio/IMS versions stay until
the 22.2 blob set is chosen.
---
 manifest.xml | 106 ++-------------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 103 deletions(-)

